    "id": "activities/2026-10-23-icomos2026",
    "body": "<h4>\n  22nd ICOMOS General Assembly and Scientific Symposium 2026\n  <a href=\"https://www.icomosga2026.org.my/\"\n     target=\"_blank\"\n     rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n     title=\"Official Website\">\n    <i class=\"fas fa-external-link-alt\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"></i>\n  </a>\n</h4>\n\n<h5 class=\"text-muted\">\n  Living Heritage: Respect. Enhance. Accept. Partnership.\n</h5>\n\n\n\n**Date:** 17–24 October 2026  \n**Location:** Borneo Convention Centre Kuching, Sarawak, Malaysia  \n**Organizer:** ICOMOS Malaysia  \n\n---\n\n<div id=\"icomosCarousel\" class=\"carousel slide my-4\" data-ride=\"carousel\" data-interval=\"2000\">\n\n  <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n\n    <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\"\n        src=\"https://archialgo-com-sources.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/images/2026-10-23-icomos2026/icomos-2026-1.jpg\"\n        alt=\"ICOMOS GA 2026 photo 1\"\n        style=\"height:480px; object-fit:contain;\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\"\n        src=\"https://archialgo-com-sources.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/images/2026-10-23-icomos2026/icomos-2026-group.jpg\"\n        alt=\"ICOMOS GA 2026 photo 2\"\n        style=\"height:480px; object-fit:contain;\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <a class=\"carousel-control-prev\"\n    href=\"#icomosCarousel\"\n    role=\"button\"\n    data-slide=\"prev\"\n    aria-label=\"Previous photo\">\n    <span style=\"color:#555; font-size:36px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8249;</span>\n  </a>\n\n  <a class=\"carousel-control-next\"\n    href=\"#icomosCarousel\"\n    role=\"button\"\n    data-slide=\"next\"\n    aria-label=\"Next photo\">\n    <span style=\"color:#555; font-size:36px;\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8250;</span>\n  </a>\n\n</div>",
