    "id": "projects/2025-10-12-ctv",
    "body": "This ongoing research project aims to develop a spatio-temporal building dataset covering **8,155 traditional villages across China**, supporting the study of settlement morphology, spatial organization, and transformation. The research combines **computer vision, multi-temporal remote sensing, and multi-source geospatial data integration** to explore scalable approaches to the automated extraction, integration, and temporal representation of built heritage data.\n\n本项目是一项正在开展的研究，旨在构建覆盖全国 **8,155 个中国传统村落**的建筑时空数据集，为历史乡村聚落的建筑形态、空间组织及其演变研究提供基础数据。研究综合运用**计算机视觉、多时相遥感分析与多源地理空间数据融合**等技术，探索大规模建成遗产空间数据的自动化提取、整合与时序表征方法。\n\n\n<div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:12px; align-items:center;\">\n\n  <img\n    src=\"/photos/project/village-dataset-1.png\"\n    alt=\"Dataset Demo - Change Detection\"\n    referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"\n    loading=\"lazy\"\n    style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; object-fit:contain; margin:0; border-radius:4px;\">\n\n\n</div>\n",
