    "body": "Working as part of a student construction team from Southeast University, the project translated Hejduk's conceptual architectural drawings into a physical exhibition installation, providing hands-on experience in architectural interpretation, physical fabrication, and assembly.\n\n参与根据海杜克“兰开斯特／汉诺威假面舞”系列作品《监狱》（Prison）进行的大尺度实体结构体制作与现场搭建。\n项目将海杜克的概念性建筑图纸转化为实体展览装置，涉及建筑作品的空间与构造解读、实体制作及现场装配实践。\n\n![PSA 2021](/photos/project/psa-cover.jpg)\n\n<h4 class=\"text-center mt-5\">Links</h4>\n\n<hr>\n\n<div class=\"wf-wechat-msg\">\n  <a class=\"wf-wechat-overlay\"\n     href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/jFnozUntZO7oKljts6gYQA\"\n     target=\"_blank\"\n     rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n     aria-label=\"Read DigitalFUTURES 2026 workshop review\"></a>\n\n  <div class=\"wf-wechat-msg-title\">\n    【PSA | 现场】“约翰·海杜克：海上假面舞”正式起舞！\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"wf-wechat-msg-desc\">\n    2021年11月12日，展览“约翰·海杜克：海上假面舞”于上海当代艺术博物馆3楼正式开展。展览丰富而翔实地呈现了一系列绘画、装置、手稿、影像以及文献资料，以及由东南大学师生为此次展览特别重建的大尺度“结构体”。……\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"wf-wechat-msg-footer\">\n    <span class=\"wf-wechat-msg-source\">PSA · 微信公众号</span>\n    <span class=\"wf-wechat-msg-action\">查看原文 ↗</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n",
